          "text": "| [Neoantigen](/wiki/education/concepts/immunology/antigen-presentation/neoantigen) | Abstract normal and altered protein strips differ at one marked block; a fragment containing that block is a candidate, followed by separate questions about HLA display and T-cell recognition. No real amino-acid sequence is shown. | `altered-protein-candidate-evidence-gates-v1-light.svg` | Present | Present |"
