          "text": "| [Self-similarity and tolerance](/wiki/education/concepts/immunology/antigen-presentation/self-similarity-and-tolerance) | Invented loaded-peptide concentration-response chart: at the same 1, 10, 100 and 1000 nanomolar concentrations, one receptor responds to both mutant and normal peptides after 24 hours. Natural processing and clinical safety remain untested. | `matched-mutant-normal-peptide-responses-v1-light.svg` | Present | Present |"
